(2) The contrapositive of "If $x>y$, then $x^2>y^2$";  
(3) The negation of "If $x\leq3$, then $x^2-x-6>0$";  
(4) The converse of "Vertical angles are equal".  
Among these, the number of true propositions is (　　)  
A: 0  
B: 1  
C: 2  
D: 3

